# Declined variant: the controller declines the "you may" (CR 603.5), so the targeted Memnite stays in the graveyard and the 3 life is still gained.
# The same game as the "hits ... returns Memnite" scenario: the equipped Ornithopter hits Bot2 and the trigger targets
# Memnite#2, but on resolution Bot1 declines, so both Memnites stay in the graveyard while Bot1 still gains 3 (CR 608.2c).

